    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "What exactly is that egg?",
            83
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "It's Cinderelik.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wait, Cinderelik?",
            85,
            "The one-winged Transcendant that follows around Vonnegut?",
            85
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Yes, her M.I.N.D. isn't stable enough for her to become a \"complete egg.\" She only managed to become something that seems like one because Cthylla is her mother.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Is she... dead?",
            87
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Can't tell for sure. She'd probably end up becoming an even more powerful magical girl if she managed to hatch from the egg.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "...Did you just say \"hatch\"?",
            89,
            "C'mon, stop with the magical girl joke already.",
            90,
            "Are you trying to crack manga jokes because you're feeling intimidated by all of this?",
            91
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "NextActionId": 93,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Yes, but she's not going to hatch in her current state.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 90,
        "ActionId": 90,
        "NextActionId": 93,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The young man shrugs."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 91,
        "ActionId": 91,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            8
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 92,
        "ActionId": 92,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Oh yeah, I'm off to the manga world tonight.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 93,
        "ActionId": 93,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wait, I remember you saying Lithos wanted me to become one of Cthylla's eggs.",
            94
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 94,
        "ActionId": 94,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "But Cinderelik is already inside the egg.",
            95,
            "Does Cthylla want to make another egg?",
            97
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 95,
        "ActionId": 95,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 96,
        "ActionId": 96,
        "NextActionId": 99,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "No one said the egg was only big enough to hold one single consciousness, so we'd better get out of here as soon as we can if we don't want to become one with her.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 97,
        "ActionId": 97,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 98,
        "ActionId": 98,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "That's a cakewalk for Cthylla, and no one said the egg was only big enough to hold one single consciousness, so we'd better get out of here as soon as we can if we don't want to become one with her.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 99,
        "ActionId": 99,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Why did she go to the lengths of becoming a Hetero-Creature, though...",
            100
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 100,
        "ActionId": 100,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Because she heard about Kugawa Kurono's death one afternoon, and she crossed off \"visit Kugawa Kurono\" from her wish list in tears.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 101,
        "ActionId": 101,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "\"He failed again, Mister. He isn't coming back to see Mother again even at the cost of picking the wrong path.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 102,
        "ActionId": 102,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "\"Let me be reborn by Mother,\" she pleaded to the agent.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 103,
        "ActionId": 103,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "\"I want to know if Mother remembers me... and I can become your key if it works. This is my final wish...\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 104,
        "ActionId": 104,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "How do you even know about this?",
            105,
            "A bit hasty, don't you think?",
            106
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 105,
        "ActionId": 105,
        "NextActionId": 107,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "They let their guard down around me sometimes.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 106,
        "ActionId": 106,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Yes, there are things she's never explicitly said, but she's now an enemy you need to crush all the same.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 107,
        "ActionId": 107,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "What do you know about Kugawa Kurono?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 108,
        "ActionId": 108,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "...It's a long story.",
            109
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 109,
        "ActionId": 109,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The young man waves his hand, dismissing further questions."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 110,
        "ActionId": 110,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "Anyhow, both Lithos and his agent see the \"egg\" as important. They think it's an amplifier of some sort, and you've seen its effects already.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 111,
        "ActionId": 111,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan?",
            "When an unstable M.I.N.D. becomes an egg, it amplifies its power and transfers the amplified power to its user, which messes up the user's M.I.N.D.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 112,
        "ActionId": 112,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
